====================================================================================================
O. renewal structure of Psi under Haar measure on the 3-adic units
  branch (h,k) has Haar mass 3^-k, consumes k digits; E[digits] = 1.500000, E[ln rho] = -0.617109, drift -0.411406 nats/digit (greedy G: ln(2/3) = -0.405465)
  dim_H(Bad_Psi) = min_theta s(theta), sum 3^(-s k) rho^theta = 1:  0.64150 (theta = 2.674)
  Haar-probability that Psi survives D digits ~ 3^(-0.3585 D) = 0.6745^D  (greedy G: 0.758751^D, dim 0.748)
  Lundberg exponent theta* = 8.64335 (E[rho^theta*] = 1): random-model worst excursion over m <= X is X^0.11570;  X=1e11: 18.74, X=1e18: 120.93
  exact number of Psi-alive unit classes mod 3^(n+1) [n: count (log_3 count / n)]:
   10:170 (0.4675)  20:71744 (0.5089)  30:50787200 (0.5384)  37:4726196440 (0.5480)  40:34421825676 (0.5521)  60:22336660497005202 (0.5711)  100:23881045418721037452378866118 (0.5948)  150:26575391496004220841474546493739681517598008 (0.6068)  200:39122051236585979742649972488628547207159823974250530233536 (0.6140)
  compare full choice (dimension lane, backward threads): 338 classes mod 3^42 (n=41), growth ~ n^1.7

